    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ashoohoocheandeanya hawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa huumeanda sirugu nihi: geendeawi ashoohoocheanda haw uurjunu, siida apteada aba meatkweeda geatinda dugwa bea hoorgeeda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA was Ng'utamiida aba humng'eeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niny siida gadiiy aba heeda ghaydit gil ea heeda maheemajeandida bea huumwaan ghayi masina siida gwasin Ng'utamiidean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba giliwas ashoohoocheanda haw iissa gealoat ghoadayda haleanjeeda ea lukghumajeega; nea eara ashoohoocheanda gammiisa gideaba gaygwandeawa gichea ghoadayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeeda gwachi gwanda badayda ng'eanyiida, ea mayghoah ashoohoocheanda earahay, nea gwanda ashoohoodiga adayiida haleanjeeda aba ginyaashta deaweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin gida uurji diita was jirooneeda haleanjeeda ghaydidi mida humng'eedean; aba gideaba damanda ramagu gwasin Musa maheemajeanda, ghoadoabiiw ASEETA, nea gwayeesha, “Sikteawana gideaba gisini haleanjeeda sean gawuurji gidaghayi siihiimdaayda aba uhuuda giijeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aba nih, Gristo ninyas gadiyeeda adareamshi muuchi adaraam dea waas gawuurji neajeeda gooduupchi muuchi, ak ea niiw deaweeda aba heeleesiinda huumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama inyeeda neajeedida bea madeedean ea manda sirjeeda, gwachi ea maygwanda gassoodeaba diita bea iyeenyean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
